**.idea/

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
**target/

# Remove Cargo.lock from gitignore if creating an executable, leave it for libraries
# More information here https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html
**Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk


# Added by cargo

/target
Cargo.lock

# Local-only working docs (design specs, notes) — never commit or push
**docs/
**.claude/

# Local-only AI-agent instruction files (read from the working tree, never uploaded)
**AGENTS.md
**CLAUDE.md
**GEMINI.md
